  &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/521xueweihan/HelloGitHub/stargazers&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/github/stars/521xueweihan/HelloGitHub.svg?style=popout-square&#34; alt=&#34;GitHub stars&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
